uote":"拾寅子易度侯好星文，甞求星書，朝議不給。寅卒，三年，以河南王世子吐谷渾易度侯為使持節、都督西秦河沙三州諸軍事、鎮西將軍、領護羌校尉、西秦河二州刺史、河南王。永明三年，詔曰：「易度侯守職西蕃，綏懷允緝，忠績兼舉，朕有嘉焉。可進號車騎大將軍。」遣給事中丘冠先使河南道，并送芮芮使。至六年乃還。得玉長三尺二寸，厚一尺一寸。","reading":"易度侯求星書及繼任都依本卷。魏書名序相反為度易侯。三年是齊授任，父卒另讀。","note":"易度侯求星書及繼任都依本卷。魏書名序相反為度易侯。三年是齊授任，父卒另讀。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p014","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":158,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:variant_review14-0","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"qed_p8w_clt","source_quote":"拾寅子易度侯好星文","reading":"本卷明記父子，求書未給至父卒、受封各有原句。","note":"本卷明記父子，求書未給至父卒、受封各有原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p014","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":9,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi059-yiduhou-father","subject_person_id":"qed_p8w_clt","object_person_id":"21y_bxj_34g","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"拾寅子易度侯"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p014","quote":"拾寅子易度侯好星文，甞求星書，朝議不給。寅卒，三年，以河南王世子吐谷渾易度侯為使持節、都督西秦河沙三州諸軍事、鎮西將軍、領護羌校尉、西秦河二州刺史、河南王。永明三年，詔曰：「易度侯守職西蕃，綏懷允緝，忠績兼舉，朕有嘉焉。可進號車騎大將軍。」遣給事中丘冠先使河南道，并送芮芮使。至六年乃還。得玉長三尺二寸，厚一尺一寸。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p014:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p014:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"魏書作度易侯，亦記父子繼立。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-qi059-xiuliumao-father","subject_person_id":"tjo_42m_hdb","object_person_id":"qed_p8w_clt","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"立其世子休留茂"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015","quote":"易度侯卒，八年，立其世子休留茂為使持節、督西秦河沙三州諸軍事、鎮西將軍、領護羌校尉、西秦河二州刺史。復遣振武將軍丘冠先拜授，并行弔禮。冠先至河南，休留茂逼令先拜，冠先厲色不肯，休留茂恥其國人，執冠先於絕巖上推墮深谷而死。冠先字道玄，吳興人，晉吏部郎傑六世孫也。上初遣冠先，示尚書令王儉，儉答上曰：「此人不啻堪行。」乃再銜命。及死，世祖敕其子雄曰：「卿父受使河南，秉忠守死，不辱王命，我甚賞惜，喪屍絕域，不可復尋，於卿後宦塗無妨，甚有高比。」賜錢十萬，布三十匹。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015:m0012","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"上一分句稱易度侯卒。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi059-yiduhou-death","person_id":"qed_p8w_clt","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015","quote":"易度侯卒，八年，立其世子休留茂為使持節、督西秦河沙三州諸軍事、鎮西將軍、領護羌校尉、西秦河二州刺史。復遣振武將軍丘冠先拜授，并行弔禮。冠先至河南，休留茂逼令先拜，冠先厲色不肯，休留茂恥其國人，執冠先於絕巖上推墮深谷而死。冠先字道玄，吳興人，晉吏部郎傑六世孫也。上初遣冠先，示尚書令王儉，儉答上曰：「此人不啻堪行。」乃再銜命。及死，世祖敕其子雄曰：「卿父受使河南，秉忠守死，不辱王命，我甚賞惜，喪屍絕域，不可復尋，於卿後宦塗無妨，甚有高比。」賜錢十萬，布三十匹。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p015:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-w